{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17632","headline":"守郡累年俄及知命聊以言志 · 羊士谔","name":"守郡累年俄及知命聊以言志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南国疑逋客，东山作老夫。\n登朝非大隐，出谷是真愚。\n气直慙龙劒，心清爱玉壶。\n聊持循吏传，早晚囗爲徒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17632.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17632","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}